.TH xml_get_text 3
.SH NAME
xml_get_text \- aggregate and clean text content from a node
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "char *xml_get_text(xmlnode *" node ", stralloc *" out ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_get_text
traverses the given
.I node
(and its next siblings if they are text nodes) to aggregate text content.
It skips leading whitespace and appends the content to
.IR out .
Returns a pointer to the resulting null-terminated string in
.IR out .